jobs.description:
Cook/kok
Our restaurant is located in Helsinge, a strategic location with many residents. We are ready to operate a variety of Asian cuisine and looking for a full-time cook.
Your main tasks:
- Preparation of ingredients and materials (rice, meat, fish, vegetab-les) for production;
- Produce various stir-fries, noodles and steamed food products;
- Responsible for food hygiene and quality-control;
- Keep the working environment clean and prevent food contamina-tion;
Your personal information:
- Ability to work in a fast-paced work environment;
- Enjoy the teamwork;
- Sense of responsibility.
We are looking for candidates who can start working as soon as pos-sible.
If you are interested in this position, please send your application and resume to hygge0814@gmail.com
